#: includes/settings-fields/layout-collage.php:86
msgid "Drag a photo onto another place in the preview to swap the two; with Random mosaic and the templates, drag a line between photos to resize them; with Scattered, drag a photo's outer edge to resize it, or drop it on a dashed frame to move it to the end of an arm; with Freeform, drag a photo anywhere (it keeps a Gap from the others) or its corner or edge to resize it, and drop it on another photo to swap the two; with Overlap, drag a photo over the others (it goes on top) or its corner or edge to resize it, and send it to the back with its button. Shuffle mixes the photos at random (Freeform, Overlap: a new layout too). All only for the device chosen (a tablet or phone without its own takes the larger screen's); Reset goes back to that, order and sizes."
